direction: right

客户端: "客户端" {style.fill: "#e3f2fd"}

accept_block: "ServerSocket.accept()\n阻塞等连接" {style.fill: "#ffcdd2"}

thread: "new Thread()\n为每个连接创建线程" {style.fill: "#fff3e0"}

read_block: "read()\n阻塞等数据" {style.fill: "#ffcdd2"}

write: "write()\n返回响应" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"}

客户端 -> accept_block: connect()
accept_block -> thread: 返回新 Socket
thread -> read_block: 调用 read()
read_block -> write: 数据到达\n拷贝到用户空间
write -> 客户端: 响应数据